00:28:10.480 --> 00:28:14.320
Watching the highschool Psykos more,&nbsp;
Fubuki came to hate who she was,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:14.320 --> 00:28:17.960
she despised that she tried to steal&nbsp;
her followers away from her. On that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:17.960 --> 00:28:22.560
day she realized that Psykos was her&nbsp;
enemy and enemies must be crushed.

