point was only able to lift a single human,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:06.640 --> 00:29:10.560
while Fubuki was able to&nbsp;
life an entire 18wheel truck.

00:29:10.560 --> 00:29:14.760
Later in a library, Psykos is seen studying&nbsp;
a new ability called the "Third Eye" that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:15.320 --> 00:29:18.720
