wont become the disaster its certain to be.

00:29:54.800 --> 00:29:58.920
Back to the moment they were confronting each&nbsp;
other during the Monster Association incident,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:58.920 --> 00:30:04.200
an already weakened Psykos was defeated and&nbsp;
captured by Fubuki, who wanted to know the source&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:04.200 --> 00:30:18.440
