future. Catching the falling Psykos in her arms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:18.440 --> 00:30:24.000
Fubuki wonders what changed her, she was never&nbsp;
a tough person. Placing her hand on her friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:24.000 --> 00:30:29.560
head, she senses mysterious presence floating&nbsp;
above them that sent a chill down her spin.

00:30:29.560 --> 00:30:33.960
Back in the present, the Blizzard Group and&nbsp;
Saitama finally arrive at Psykos's interment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:33.960 --> 00:30:38.840
unit just as she is about to be taken away&nbsp;
by that random man. Fubuki informs everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:38.840 --> 00:30:43.520
present that the visitation is over and the&nbsp;
need to evacuate the room immediately. Due&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:43.520 --> 00:30:48.920
