Tatsumaki attempts to bury Psykos in rubble.&nbsp;
Luckily, Fubuki and the random react in time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:04.840 --> 00:31:09.040
managing to put up an energy orb around&nbsp;
Psykos. Seeing the random try and attack her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:09.040 --> 00:31:13.240
Tatsumaki with just a glance sends the&nbsp;
random dude shooting off into the wall.

00:31:14.080 --> 00:31:18.080
Fubuki screams for all the representatives&nbsp;
to escape back to the surface and commands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:18.080 --> 00:31:22.640
her guys to start attacking her sister. Getting&nbsp;
reading to send a blast in her sisters direction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:22.640 --> 00:31:26.520
it suddenly skips back in time&nbsp;
to a dinner date between the two.

00:31:26.520 --> 00:31:29.680
There Tatsumaki explained that&nbsp;
the same guys who captured her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:29.680 --> 00:31:33.680
