making it look like they aren't together.

00:31:43.320 --> 00:31:48.200
Skipping back to the fight, the random esper who&nbsp;
managed to survive Tatsumaki’s blow, gets back up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:48.200 --> 00:31:53.200
