tries to say that he honestly doesn't remember,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:23.840 --> 00:32:29.480
but its not like she was even listening. She&nbsp;
fought Garou too and it was obvious he was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:29.480 --> 00:32:34.200
someone who had reached a peak then ascended&nbsp;
it. If Saitama did truly take him down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:34.200 --> 00:32:40.000
then he must have ascended aswell. Fubuki gave&nbsp;
up on being the strongest a long time ago and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:40.000 --> 00:32:44.420
