The facilities the association provides are on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:36.760 --> 00:33:40.840
par if not better than any other place and&nbsp;
they’ve got even more planned. There isn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:40.840 --> 00:33:45.000
