state of the art earthquake restraints.

00:33:59.160 --> 00:34:03.160
As it all seems to come to a stop, a sudden&nbsp;
clash between Tatsumaki and the mysterious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:03.160 --> 00:34:07.080
dude creates a powerful earthquake that&nbsp;
knocks all of the rich people off their feet.

00:34:07.080 --> 00:34:11.520
Over in the control center, hell is breaking&nbsp;
lose as they try and quickly discover the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:11.520 --> 00:34:15.880
location of this shaking. Noticing that its&nbsp;
coming from the experimental monster floor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:15.880 --> 00:34:18.640
the man in charge screams out&nbsp;
to get some hero’s down there.

00:34:18.640 --> 00:34:22.720
Back in the battle between espers and noticing&nbsp;
that he’s still at a slight disadvantage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:22.720 --> 00:34:26.880
Tatsumaki mocks him asking if the poor little&nbsp;
guinea pig ever thought he stood a chance?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:27.480 --> 00:34:31.320
Getting distracted for a moment, Tatsumaki&nbsp;
notices her sister fainting after trying to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:31.320 --> 00:34:35.920
re-open the whole in the floor. In actuality&nbsp;
though its revealed that previously before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:35.920 --> 00:34:41.080
