sisters group. Complementing her listening skills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:57.600 --> 00:35:03.080
the male esper demands that Tatsumaki not resist.&nbsp;
Joking that he needs to make her slightly easier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:03.080 --> 00:35:08.240
to carry, Tatsumaki is suddenly forced into a&nbsp;
binding of psychic power. While holding her he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:08.240 --> 00:35:13.000
explains that the espers are a defective&nbsp;
species that need to go extinct. Throwing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:17.000
