He explains that no one would care if both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:21.160 --> 00:35:25.040
of the sisters died due to Tatsumaki’s&nbsp;
rage unleashing all of these monsters.

00:35:25.600 --> 00:35:28.840
Emerging from the Fubuki group&nbsp;
the Spy jumps up and fly's off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:28.840 --> 00:35:31.280
