00:35:31.280 --> 00:35:34.320
As the plasmafeild holding back&nbsp;
the monsters begins to disappear,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:34.320 --> 00:35:38.640
all of the weak Fubuki members try and&nbsp;
close the door, but it just wont work.

00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:41.760
With a terrifying screech, all of&nbsp;
the Demon-level monsters slowly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:41.760 --> 00:35:45.440
