avail. Instead its shown that Tatsumaki,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:03.400 --> 00:36:08.320
within milliseconds of receiving her power back,&nbsp;
had managed to find and neutralize. She managed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:08.320 --> 00:36:12.760
to do this by copying the wavelength of her&nbsp;
opponent espers telekinetic signals and turning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:12.760 --> 00:36:17.520
the pill into a needle thinner than a strand of&nbsp;
hair. Following this, Tatsumaki pulls the needle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:17.520 --> 00:36:22.400
out of Fubuki's body and directs it towards her&nbsp;
enemies face. Putting up his hands to stop it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:22.400 --> 00:36:28.040
the Tsukuyomi member can do nothing as it pierces&nbsp;
his hands and stabs directly into his right eye.

00:36:28.040 --> 00:36:32.560
Noticing that he didnt die instantly from&nbsp;
the attack, Tatsumaki menacingly threatens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:32.560 --> 00:36:37.560
him as she intends to wring his body until all&nbsp;
information on the Tsukuyomi group is revealed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:37.560 --> 00:36:41.920
Using her psychic abilities, Tatsumaki collapses&nbsp;
the complete room in on this random dude and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:41.920 --> 00:36:46.760
