The spy desperately tries to flee the scene but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:52.040
Tatsumaki glances in his direction and sends him&nbsp;
crashing into a nearby wall, knocking him out.

00:36:52.040 --> 00:36:56.120
With the Tsukuyomi members defeated and the&nbsp;
situation solved, the Blizzard Group rushes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:56.120 --> 00:36:57.160
