00:37:39.960 --> 00:37:42.360
Fubuki screams out for her sister to stop,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:42.360 --> 00:37:46.640
however the one to grab the espers hand&nbsp;
and put a stop to this complete rage fest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:46.640 --> 00:37:51.960
