this is going to far just to lecture someone!

00:37:57.520 --> 00:38:03.120
In another place, Air suddenly awakens in the Hero&nbsp;
Association hospital. Speaking up, Forte who was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:03.840 --> 00:38:08.560
