a moment and was taken out by a random monster.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:13.360 --> 00:38:19.520
Wondering who he actually is, Forte introduces&nbsp;
himself to Air as the rank 31 Hero and someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:19.520 --> 00:38:25.440
