00:38:50.200 --> 00:38:55.640
Seeing that he’s being ignored, Butterfly DX&nbsp;
asks Forte what’s getting him so riled up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:55.640 --> 00:38:59.920
its not like he should be taking his anger out&nbsp;
on others to start with. Not listening to him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:59.920 --> 00:39:03.400
Forte just goes on a fat rant about&nbsp;
how, once he leaves here he’s gonna&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:03.400 --> 00:39:08.120
get his revenge on that douche bag named Saitama&nbsp;
or something. That guy acted like some dumbass,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:08.120 --> 00:39:12.880
but turned out to be one tricky genius with an&nbsp;
abnormal ability. Forte asks his boys if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:12.880 --> 00:39:17.840
all saw it aswell... Saitama was right there in&nbsp;
front of him, then randomly out of absolutely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:17.840 --> 00:39:22.160
nowhere he was assaulted by an attack that&nbsp;
sent him straight to hospital. On top of that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:22.160 --> 00:39:27.760
his ankle is broken and he has a crazy ass&nbsp;
whiplash. Its almost as if he was hit by a car.

00:39:27.760 --> 00:39:33.200
Getting close to him, both of Forte’s boys&nbsp;
let him know that it was a car... Plus he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:33.200 --> 00:39:36.920
