battle, as the guy was just trying to help.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:37.600 --> 00:39:42.960
Realizing how freaking stupid he is, Forte asks&nbsp;
them to forget about everything he just said.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:42.960 --> 00:39:47.000
He’d honestly thought he was just like Tatsumaki&nbsp;
and was the owner of some cheat-level psychic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:47.000 --> 00:39:52.640
abilities. To which hearing that, butterfly&nbsp;
remarks that if it was her, he’d be dead.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:56.440
Bringing the trio back to reality, Forte&nbsp;
wonders what the hell the shaking was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:56.440 --> 00:40:00.840
earlier. Knowing some of the information,&nbsp;
Butterfly DX says that it was some monsters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:00.840 --> 00:40:04.760
in the jailhouse going rampant, but will&nbsp;
go and source more info while he rests.

00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:11.120
Meanwhile, and after having her hand grabbed&nbsp;
by the big man, Tatsumaki asks if he’s deaf&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:11.120 --> 00:40:15.640
