Saitama replies that he’s just trying to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:15.640 --> 00:40:19.440
her to calm the actual hell down, causing the&nbsp;
esper to attempt to throw saitama through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:19.440 --> 00:40:24.280
Associations base. Looking at the force being&nbsp;
exerted on him, Saitama wonders if this was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:24.280 --> 00:40:29.360
the same ability that sent Geno’s flying and tells&nbsp;
Tatsumaki that right now she’s no different power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:29.360 --> 00:40:35.680
wise from Fubuki. Fubuki screams out in horror&nbsp;
not wanting Saitama to enrage her sister anymore.

00:40:35.680 --> 00:40:40.280
Just straight up pissed now, Tatsumaki screams for&nbsp;
him to let go and begins trying to twist the bald&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:40.280 --> 00:40:45.080
