with a look im sure ive never seen before,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:25.200 --> 00:41:30.120
questions if thats the true reason as to why&nbsp;
he’s here now. Taking this question as asking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:30.120 --> 00:41:35.920
